  "new_judgments": [
    "Hidden notes as slur anchors and hidden stems with visible tie endpoints are different constructions; neither warrants deleting events.",
    "Cross-staff common stems, alternate tremolo objects and same-hand chord brackets convey different relationships; inspect members rather than software object names.",
    "Pedal endpoint graphics may extend beyond unchanged On/Off events and confuse reading; MIDI equality alone would not accept them.",
    "force-hshift snippet staff-space unit statement conflicts with same-version internals; official tagged C++ multiplies the forced value by selected notehead width.",
    "Ordinary high/low dotted seconds and crossed voices require different side choices; a single prefer-dotted-right global policy is insufficient."
  ],
